Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-First Episode\NThe Magic Cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to wake up\NPrince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, it is time to go to the\Nsecret room for your lessons!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Garigori, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.22,0:02:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sapphire! You must\Nstudy at least until nine o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You are very late\Nthis morning, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:03:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Put this dress on right\Naway. I will help you. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the dress that my\Nmother had prepared for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is. You must take\Ncooking and sewing lessons...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...to be able to become as\Ngood as your dear mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I will take the lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't go horseback\Nriding in this dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You would appreciate it more if\Nyou behaved more like a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me help you!\N- No, I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on!\N- I want to do it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How pretty you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, to start,\Nslice this bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it! I don't know how!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you warm up the knife, you'll\Nbe able to slice it more easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this, look! Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Chop! Chop! Chop!\N- I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to do it!\NI don't know how to cut it well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a knife\Nthat's a bit longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:04:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,See if you can do better\Nwith this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good! This one works!\N- Be careful not to cut yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's very sharp.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, Princess!\NWhat do you want to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! This cuts much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But when you cook,\Nyou must use the right tools
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right...\N- Good morning, everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good morning, Your Majesty!\N- Did you sleep well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But tell me:\Nwho is that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!\NBut you really are Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Here is breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You are really very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, father!\NAnd you are served too, mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are\Na beautiful and good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do everything,\Nif I only try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? What's happening?\NWhy are you shouting?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, nothing...\NDon't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How messy you are!\NI had arranged them so well!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sorry... Do you want to spread\Nthe tablecloth now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?... Ah, this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I forgive you, but\Nhurry up, please, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All things considered, it would have been\Nbetter if you were born a boy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why so early?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I wanted to tell you that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?!\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the pastry!\NStand up straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do a somersault! Bark!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I put the medicine in\Nit that forces people...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,..to obey any order!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Have many pastries made immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And make sure the King, the\NQueen and Sapphire eat them today,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,during afternoon tea,\Ntogether with the other pastries!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:05:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you eat\Nmy pastry?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The pastries force people\Nto obey any order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, damn parrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate it! I ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you dressed again\Nas a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, finally! Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanted to raise her\Nas a boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...and now she's a tomboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, parrot! Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, it stopped all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come onto my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be\NNylon's parrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.14,0:06:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my parrot!\NMy little parrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, Prince!\N- Is it yours? I'll give it back to you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter,\NI'll take it back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have to take\Na long walk! Long!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange...! There's something\Nwrong with this parrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.46,0:06:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, tell me everything you know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- If you eat those pastries...\N- What happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have some pastries made!\N- Make some pastries?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But what pastries\Nare you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin! This parrot\Ntalked about pastries...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...that force people\Nto obey any order!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.82,0:07:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pastries that force you\Nto obey orders?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, do you know anything about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about\Nit. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying! A moment\Nago it seemed like you knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell is happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.98,0:07:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like you had\Na horrible dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they will use\Nthose pastries...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,..for some conspiracy of theirs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The pastries will surely be made\Nin some pastry shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll manage to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:08:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Prince Sapphire, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where are you going?\N- There's a pastry shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the woods!\NI'm going to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We are also going to the woods\Nto see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The walls are made\Nof sponge cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The snow on the roof is whipped cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The pebbles made of popcorn\Nare delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Delicious!\N- What a beautiful, delicious place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, you damn kids
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make some pastries\Nthat were ordered,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so get out of my way\Nand let me work in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ordered... Just as I thought! It's\Nlikely they are having them made here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, go to the castle and bring me\Nmy girl's dress right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This will do!\NYou, Opal, wait for me here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is disturbing me?\NI'm busy, for heaven's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a customer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I want to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that the pastry chef...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.30,0:09:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...needed someone to\Nhelp him with his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, can you let\Nme work with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I have so much\Nto do that I'll take you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you make pastries\Nin such a small room?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Do you perhaps think I can\Nmake pastries inside pastries? Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! There's\Na room underground!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great place\Nto work! It's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, since I am the\Nbest pastry chef in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and light the fire\Nin that oven, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, lighting a fire\Nis super easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.38,0:10:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't you even know how to\Nlight a fire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.26,0:10:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,\Nbut this wood is wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've turned...\Nblack as coal...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...even the pastry dough! It's ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we won't be able to\Nmake the pastries anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! I will make them at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Before tea time!\NYou clean everything up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll put in the medicine\Nthat I was ordered to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come here to help me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a nice handful of dough\Nand shape the pastry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterward, I will put it in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, it's too big!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But how misshapen mine are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.54,0:12:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to make\Nany more. Put mine in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it! I will mess up on purpose\Nand drop all the pastries!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid! Why don't you\Ntry to be more careful?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Mr. Pastry Chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you aren't capable\Nof doing such a simple job?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a child could do it!\NCan't you be less distracted?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.94,0:12:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, did you make the pastries?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm baking them right\Nnow! Just wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.94,0:12:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my assistant.\NThey are done now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come here and help me, come on!\N- I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.18,0:12:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Great! Thank you,\NMr. Pastry Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.14,0:12:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I have a question to ask:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this medicine\Nthat I put in the pastries?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not poison, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no! Only Vitamin C.\N- I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Why did you\Nsay "I don't believe it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know something\Nabout these pastries?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:13:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me... I... I don't know\Nanything about this medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.54,0:13:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,These pastries are\Nreally very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...! Then you will\Neat these pastries...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...in which Vitamin C\Nhas been put! Eat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat them! Eat them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Try eating them! Come on, eat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.94,0:13:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat them, come on! Come\Non! I order you to eat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.26,0:13:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Get her! That girl\Nknows about the pastries!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.22,0:13:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let her\Nescape! Go, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop! Stop!\N- Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.02,0:14:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who ordered these\Npastries from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me! Who ordered\Nthese pastries from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine! If you don't want to\Ntell me, it doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking them with me anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Pastry Chef, please\Ngive me those pastries!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So you weren't a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no! I will deliver them\Nto the man who ordered them from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to take them!\NYou'd better give them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.70,0:14:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, absolutely not!\NI absolutely cannot give them to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- What happened?\N- I couldn't get them, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?! Perhaps the pastry chef\Nhadn't made them yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!\NPrince Sapphire came?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am, Mr. Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.38,0:15:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear anything more about Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.18,0:15:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back there and this time\Ntake the pastries!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And do whatever you want\Nwith Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.10,0:15:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to take those pastries!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to stop me anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!\NAnd now deal with Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.02,0:16:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot! Don't shoot!\NI am the pastry chef! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.82,0:16:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to tell\Nanyone anything about the pastries,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so, to silence you,\NI will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! Dirty cowards!\NThey tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you that I didn't know\Nthat that medicine was poisonous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.34,0:16:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know! I only obeyed\Nby making those pastries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And do you know who they want\Nto eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as I know, they want\Neveryone at the castle to eat them:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the King, the Queen, the Prince...\NIn short, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!\NI forgot something important:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,they will be eaten during tea\Nthis afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!\NBut tea time will be here soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:17:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, there is still a\Nwhole package of pastries left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to get those men\Nout there to eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, they will be\Nas obedient as that parrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.78,0:17:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well, you who\Nhave eaten my pastries!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there is no more\Nneed for you to hunt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir!\N- See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The pastry medicine\Nhas taken effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, we won't get in your way anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you must tell me who it was\Nwho ordered you to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know his name.\NI didn't even see him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,because he gave the order\Nto our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, hurry up\Nand return to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.22,0:18:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm going!\N- And you, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.34,0:18:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Never return to this forest again!\NI order you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- But at least are they good?\N- They are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I had them made\Nby the best pastry chef in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Now deliver them to the servants!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure that everyone who\Nis close to Sapphire eats them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.42,0:18:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you have killed\Nthe man who made them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They are killing him now,\Nalong with Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.82,0:18:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Along with Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure they can manage\Nto kill him? Sapphire is strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am absolutely sure they will!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will carry out\Na plan of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Special troops! Special troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin orders you to kill\Nthe King and his family!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.82,0:19:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The medicine calmed those wild\Nmen in a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mom and Dad\Ntake that horrible medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,they will be forever obedient\Nto Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.30,0:19:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it's tea time
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.26,0:19:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Put everything on the table\Nand call the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We will have tea all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.34,0:20:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gunpowder arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them, Opal! Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, or I will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gave you\Nthe order to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We were ordered\Nby our Captain, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie, soldier! It must have\Nbeen an order from Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know!\N- Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the horse\Ngo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- You will return on foot.\N- Very well, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.90,0:20:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Aren't they coming?\N- They will arrive soon, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- In the meantime, eat.\N- No, I will wait for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,These pastries\Nlook delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- I apologize for the delay.\N- Forgive me, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.\NAnyway, you are always late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire has arrived!\NOpen the gates at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.78,0:21:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?\NOpen immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,These pastries\Nlook delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't you think?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Sapphire will ever be\Nable to make ones just like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.74,0:21:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, one day,\Nwill make even better ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.38,0:22:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, mother, forgive\Nme if I had to act this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Those pastries were poisoned!\N- Good heavens! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.86,0:22:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Sapphire?\NTell me everything, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I cannot accuse anyone\Nof having ordered them,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,because I lack the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.78,0:22:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire has managed\Nto get on his side...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...our accomplices,\Nwith the help of those pastries.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.82,0:22:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I overcooked them, but I'm\Nsure they must be delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.90,0:23:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad...\NReally not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.30,0:23:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't tell\Nthat it's the first time you've made them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad\Nthat they turned out well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But it tastes bad! It's bitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you will manage to do\Neverything that girls do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.82,0:23:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With a little effort,\Nyou will learn to make...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.86,0:23:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...even the most delicious\Nsweets in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe\Nthat I will learn to cook, father?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.70,0:24:12.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:15.68,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
